- Sculptor mesh code in public/js/sculpt/vendor/ (SculptorMesh.js, SculptorUtils.js), from three.js r186
  examples/jsm/misc, MIT License, three.js authors. It adapts SculptGL by Stéphane Ginier
  (https://github.com/stephomi/sculptgl), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 Stéphane GINIER; that notice is
  kept in the file headers and in public/js/sculpt/vendor/LICENSE-SculptGL.txt.

- Blender (https://www.blender.org). The sculpt brush, stroke and falloff code in public/js/sculpt/ (outside
  vendor/) is translated from Blender's source at commit 235621eec717437a8dfe0a9dfbf78a3f7eb4c32f
  (source/blender/editors/sculpt_paint and related files), which is GPL-2.0-or-later. It is distributed here
